type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも私の背中を押してください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"辛い時があれば泣きます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも絶対、最高の笑顔を忘れないから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベビたんの笑顔が好き"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と言ってくださるみなさん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑って‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にーーーーーーーーーー‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/19/2834876/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前向きになれるのはみなさんのおかげ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パワーアップした万理華を見ててください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも感謝。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんがだいすきです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベビたん*****bA by marika"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-24498":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"12thシングル「太陽ノック」\nいよいよ発売になりました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダー曲はtype-C\n愛未とのペアPVはtype-A\nブックレットはセブンイレブン盤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"を手に取っていただけたら\n私を見つけてもらえるかなと\n思います(＊´ω`＊)これ言うの遅かったね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新曲の感想、MV・PVの感想、\n聞かせてくださーい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「別れ際、もっと好きになる」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても好き。なんか切ない曲好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌詞は私たちにはちょっと\n背伸びした感じもするけ